# Goal: run the swag-delivery mission (pickup -> deliver -> hand-off -> drop-off).
# 'map_name' optionally selects a saved marker set / map; empty → use the live
# recorder table if present, else the default sidecar on disk.
string map_name
---
# Result
bool success
string reason
---
# Feedback: human-readable mission stage, e.g. "nav_to_pickup", "aligning_pickup",
# "arm_pickup", "nav_to_delivery", "await_handoff", "arm_dropoff".
string stage
